-- Gl. B.1  Q_V
update public.equations set verification_quote='Für das Becken 1 lässt sich die durch die Leckage ständig entweichende Luftmenge wie folgt bestimmen: | Q_{v}=2,79 \cdot d_{i}^{2} \cdot l \cdot \frac{\Delta p}{\Delta t} \quad\left(\mathrm{~m}_{N}^{3} / \mathrm{h}\right) \tag{B.1} | Die Temperatur ist mit durchschnittlich $50^{\circ} \mathrm{C}$ angenommen. — printed p.49', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-07 (Anhang B Gl.B.1, printed p.49) [VC] — quote backfill only, status untouched. Constant re-derived independently: (pi/4)*3600/1013 = 2,791, i.e. pipe volume (m3) times pressure drop rate (hPa/s) referred to p_N = 1013 hPa and converted to per-hour — the printed 2,79 and the printed output unit mN3/h agree. No hidden per-minute/per-hour factor', verified_at=now() where id='5ddab6f2-572e-4c09-a341-b6fb98eda20a' and verification_quote is null;
